    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/1bcbd755fab3d1be3ddca1327ff4423d.poster.avif?t=1752154644\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/1bcbd755fab3d1be3ddca1327ff4423d.webm?t=1752154644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/1bcbd755fab3d1be3ddca1327ff4423d.mp4?t=1752154644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psynostic</strong> is a <strong>game</strong> that let you <strong>incarn a psychologis</strong>t. <strong>Find</strong> the <strong>words</strong> to <strong>make</strong> your <strong>patient speak</strong> and <strong>make</strong> the <strong>good diagnostic</strong>. You have a <strong>full liberty </strong>of<strong> questions available</strong> thanks to the <strong>LLM</strong> (<strong>L</strong>arge <strong>L</strong>anguage <strong>M</strong>odel). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use</strong> your <strong>diagnostic book</strong> to have <strong>guideline</strong> about <strong>potential questions</strong> and to <strong>keep track</strong> of your <strong>suspected diagnostic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/cc2388a23c71b3caf84218cec19903a7.poster.avif?t=1752154644\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/cc2388a23c71b3caf84218cec19903a7.webm?t=1752154644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/cc2388a23c71b3caf84218cec19903a7.mp4?t=1752154644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/90c38d16734eeae487b6b290c88f94b4.avif?t=1752154644\" data-has-big width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psynostic use new IA model to offer the best gaming experience. The LLM allows full liberty for the player. There are multiple ways to get info about the patient and conduct a diagnostic like in real life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is LLM ?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LLM stand for Large Language Model and is behind every recent chatbot like ChatGPT. Basicaly what it does is text completion. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psynostic use the Whisper model which is the best speech-to-text available. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/80b209a44f79e0de261aaca31ef348a9.avif?t=1752154644\" data-has-big width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an psychologist you work in your own office but sometime you may help the Justice and diagnostic criminal. Your mission is to know if the criminal is responsible for his act. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 16 unique characters to diagnostic with their own story. Some of them are criminal, other aren't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/088c42abf4c4beebd531223a7a2b4448.avif?t=1752154644\" data-has-big width=800 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a system of detection of emotion. It use a python package to detect the emotion from text. The system will automatically adjust the shape of the bubble and the text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/1bcbd755fab3d1be3ddca1327ff4423d.poster.avif?t=1752154644\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/1bcbd755fab3d1be3ddca1327ff4423d.webm?t=1752154644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/1bcbd755fab3d1be3ddca1327ff4423d.mp4?t=1752154644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psynostic</strong> is a <strong>game</strong> that let you <strong>incarn a psychologis</strong>t. <strong>Find</strong> the <strong>words</strong> to <strong>make</strong> your <strong>patient speak</strong> and <strong>make</strong> the <strong>good diagnostic</strong>. You have a <strong>full liberty </strong>of<strong> questions available</strong> thanks to the <strong>LLM</strong> (<strong>L</strong>arge <strong>L</strong>anguage <strong>M</strong>odel). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use</strong> your <strong>diagnostic book</strong> to have <strong>guideline</strong> about <strong>potential questions</strong> and to <strong>keep track</strong> of your <strong>suspected diagnostic</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/cc2388a23c71b3caf84218cec19903a7.poster.avif?t=1752154644\" width=800 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/cc2388a23c71b3caf84218cec19903a7.webm?t=1752154644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/cc2388a23c71b3caf84218cec19903a7.mp4?t=1752154644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/90c38d16734eeae487b6b290c88f94b4.avif?t=1752154644\" data-has-big width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psynostic use new IA model to offer the best gaming experience. The LLM allows full liberty for the player. There are multiple ways to get info about the patient and conduct a diagnostic like in real life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is LLM ?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LLM stand for Large Language Model and is behind every recent chatbot like ChatGPT. Basicaly what it does is text completion. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psynostic use the Whisper model which is the best speech-to-text available. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/80b209a44f79e0de261aaca31ef348a9.avif?t=1752154644\" data-has-big width=800 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an psychologist you work in your own office but sometime you may help the Justice and diagnostic criminal. Your mission is to know if the criminal is responsible for his act. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 16 unique characters to diagnostic with their own story. Some of them are criminal, other aren't. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380580/extras/088c42abf4c4beebd531223a7a2b4448.avif?t=1752154644\" data-has-big width=800 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a system of detection of emotion. It use a python package to detect the emotion from text. The system will automatically adjust the shape of the bubble and the text.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
